  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_first_00",
      "hash64": "EBABC513F7C8498C",
      "text": "吾辈来自学院。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_first_01",
      "hash64": "EBABC613F7C84B3F",
      "text": "名字叫做萨瓦罗，\\n今后请多关照。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "08417CABC4CB6A50",
      "text": "果真是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你啊。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "08417DABC4CB6C03",
      "text": "吾辈听说有个很优秀的学生\\n在留学的学校成绩很好，\\r\\n还被委托招募人才。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "08417EABC4CB6DB6",
      "text": "吾辈还想着这得是多么杰出的人啊。\\n结果是你，那就难怪了。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "56C5850AFD03903A",
      "text": "谢谢您！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "56C5840AFD038E87",
      "text": "那肯定的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "08417FABC4CB6F69",
      "text": "呼……这种坦率\\n就是你成功的秘诀吗？[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp01_03b",
      "hash64": "D2BAFBDF65ADAFB1",
      "text": "呼……这种调皮\\n就是你成功的秘诀吗？[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "084180ABC4CB711C",
      "text": "自己教的学生能有这么大的成就，\\n对吾辈来说也是件可喜的事。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "084181ABC4CB72CF",
      "text": "为了不输给[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你，\\n吾辈也会在学园尽力而为的。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "35FB06B227A63AFF",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n可以和你聊一会儿吗？[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "35FB05B227A6394C",
      "text": "吾辈也买了手机壳，\\n并装在了手机上。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "35FB08B227A63E65",
      "text": "这样装，\\n没问题吧？[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "3465931329A1841B",
      "text": "没问题！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "3465941329A185CE",
      "text": "好可爱！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp02_select_03",
      "hash64": "3465951329A18781",
      "text": "和派帕同款！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "35FB07B227A63CB2",
      "text": "那真是太好了！\\n毕竟像这种尝试，吾辈还是第一次……[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp02_03b",
      "hash64": "5FCAE3B95F795570",
      "text": "哦！是这样呀！\\n你也这么认为吗！？\\r\\n吾辈自己也是很喜欢的！[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp02_03c",
      "hash64": "5FCAE4B95F795723",
      "text": "哦？居然和他成了同款啊？\\n派帕同学的品味也不错嘛。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "35FB02B227A63433",
      "text": "这个花花手机壳\\n只在玻瓶市有卖，\\r\\n让吾辈把商店找了个遍。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "35FB01B227A63280",
      "text": "最后能买到不错的手机壳，\\n吾辈很满意。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "8C60D0B9C30FFB6E",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n你知道吗？[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "8C60D1B9C30FFD21",
      "text": "在生态巨蛋，\\n有种名为小仙奶的鲜奶油宝可梦。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "8C60CEB9C30FF808",
      "text": "它可爱的外表就不用说了，\\n那由身体散发出来的甜～甜香气\\r\\n拥有难以言表的魅力……[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "8C60CFB9C30FF9BB",
      "text": "你知道小仙奶那别具一格的\\n进化方法是什么吗？[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "A71868C0337C82E0",
      "text": "转圈圈",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "A7186BC0337C87F9",
      "text": "夸它可爱",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp03_select_03",
      "hash64": "A7186AC0337C8646",
      "text": "喂它吃甜食",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "8C60D4B9C310023A",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，你答得太对了。\\n你已经试过了吗？[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp03_04b",
      "hash64": "988BCFA67433FB88",
      "text": "嗯嗯！你夸它可爱的话，\\n你们都会笑得很开心。\\r\\n但这样是不可能进化的。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp03_04c",
      "hash64": "988BD0A67433FD3B",
      "text": "嗯嗯！你们一起吃花生酱三明治的话，\\n就会好吃到进化！\\r\\n……怎么可能会有这种事！[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "8C60D5B9C31003ED",
      "text": "要想让小仙奶进化成霜奶仙，\\n就需要带着它同行，\\r\\n并转圈圈。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "8C60D2B9C30FFED4",
      "text": "这样一来，鲜奶油经过搅拌，\\n就会变成松松软软的霜奶仙了。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp03_07",
      "hash64": "8C60D3B9C3100087",
      "text": "在那之前，\\n不要忘了让小仙奶携带糖饰。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp03_08",
      "hash64": "8C60C8B9C30FEDD6",
      "text": "根据携带的糖饰和你转圈的方式，\\n霜奶仙的外表会有所不同，要注意哦。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp03_09",
      "hash64": "8C60C9B9C30FEF89",
      "text": "吾辈也是为了让自己的霜奶仙\\n变成现在的外表，调整了转圈的方式。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "8B53AE341D6CAE18",
      "text": "吾辈之所以能遇到霜奶仙，\\n也是因为你把吾辈叫来了学园。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "8B53AF341D6CAFCB",
      "text": "你去过各种地方，\\n应该遇到过很多不错的宝可梦吧。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "8B53B0341D6CB17E",
      "text": "我们能否来交换宝可梦，\\n让吾辈了解一下你走过的轨迹呢？[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_trade_01_03",
      "hash64": "8B53B1341D6CB331",
      "text": "吾辈打算选出提布莉姆。\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，你呢？[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_trade_01_04",
      "hash64": "8B53B2341D6CB4E4",
      "text": "吾辈有种仿佛参与了\\n一部分你的冒险的感觉。\\c\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n感谢你和吾辈交换。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_trade_02_00",
      "hash64": "B75AB83A7ED6C3C7",
      "text": "就用[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你的[VAR 0x0101(0001)]和\\n吾辈的提布莉姆来交换，确定了吗？[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_trade_02_01",
      "hash64": "B75AB73A7ED6C214",
      "text": "无法使用初训家不是自己的\\n宝可梦进行交换。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_trade_02_02",
      "hash64": "B75ABA3A7ED6C72D",
      "text": "无法使用稀有宝可梦\\n进行交换。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_trade_02_03",
      "hash64": "B75AB93A7ED6C57A",
      "text": "无法使用异色宝可梦\\n进行交换。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_trade_03_00",
      "hash64": "0F06E2421B55E9F6",
      "text": "……同行宝可梦只有１只的话，\\n还是不要交换了吧。\\c\\n等你带着２只以上的宝可梦之后\\n再来试试吧，如何？[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_trade_03_01",
      "hash64": "0F06E3421B55EBA9",
      "text": "等你想交换的时候也行，\\n到时就拜托你啦。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_trade_04_00",
      "hash64": "59AEBC0A6433D32D",
      "text": "你愿意和吾辈交换宝可梦吗？[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_talkto_00",
      "hash64": "9336FEEFF4648D81",
      "text": "冠军，\\n你要和吾辈对战吗？[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_cancel_00",
      "hash64": "5720D8B1BDA700E2",
      "text": "吾辈已经做好了准备，\\n随时欢迎你来。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_battlestart_00",
      "hash64": "6D8C5A8016A23818",
      "text": "那么务必让我们来对战吧。\\n吾辈要好好拿出实力来了。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_battlestart_01",
      "hash64": "ABAAB30995052C73",
      "text": "[EMPTY 66]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
